OL,3,GNEWSAAward nominee helping to create
OL,4,Abrighter futures
OL,5,
OL,6,FA manager for a charity has been
OL,7,Fpraised for her fundraising work to
OL,8,Fhelp make futures brighter.
OL,10,FJude Hanson, who has been nominated for
OL,11,Fthe BBC Radio Jersey Make a Difference
OL,12,FAwards, has raised millions of pounds
OL,13,Ffor Brighter Futures over the last
OL,14,Feight years in her role as trusts and
OL,15,Fgrants manager.
OL,17,FBrighter Futures helps 150 families in
OL,18,FJersey through its support work and
OL,19,Fsaid it needed to raise more than #1m
OL,20,Fayear to cover its costs.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
