OL,3,GNEWSAAward nominee helping to create
OL,4,Abrighter futures
OL,5,
OL,6,FChief executive Fionna Brennan said:
OL,7,F"Without the funding we can't operate.
OL,8,FJude is out there looking for every way
OL,9,Fthat we can raise funds."
